<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Kulicke &amp; Soffa a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kulicke &amp; Soffa a buy.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robertson, Stephens &amp; Co analyst Sue Billat started coverage of Kulicke &amp; Soffa Industries Inc, a maker of semiconductor assembly equipment and packaging materials, with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- called the company &quot;a franchise player&quot; in its market segment and said &quot;the company is particularly well positioned with its latest generation of wire bonders,&quot; which are used to wire microchips to their packaging.</p>
</text>
